#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# 仓库内外统一 LF：不依赖各机器的 core.autocrlf，检出即 LF，
# 避免 Windows(core.autocrlf=true) 与 Linux/CI 之间来回转换产生
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告和噪音 diff。
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Linux start script should use lf
/mvnw           text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
# cmd.exe 对 LF 行尾的 goto/label 解析不可靠，批处理必须留 CRLF
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf
